{"cue": 1, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Ah, well, that does it. 2,000 Sullivan for Congress flyers ready to fly."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No problem."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "We love monotonous, servile labor."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Dan, you're supposed to be licking this envelope."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I sprained my tongue."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "There's a campaign commercial coming along."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, it's going out to the television stations tonight, and I must say, Matt"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "did a good job directing it."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Really? I thought you said he went way over budget."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, at first. But after I threw out the original musical score and mixed the"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "underwater dream sequence, we were left with a pretty fascinating 30 seconds."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So what's in it?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Me talking?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "For 30 whole seconds?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hope you were naked."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What you reading, Ross?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Humor in uniform?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No, that's what I'm looking at."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "This is a letter from my pen pal."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Is it a he-pal or a she-pal?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "A he-pal, and his name is Alex."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, how delicious."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Two lonely scribes penning explicit boudoir details accompanied by how-to"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "photos?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "It's nothing like that."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Then why waste the stamp?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So, how'd you start writing?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, Alex had my apartment before I moved in. But when he moved to"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "California, his mail kept coming."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So I sent him a note telling him if he didn't do something about it, the next"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "package he'd get from me would explode in his face."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How charming."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I guess I did charm him. Because the next thing I know, he started writing to"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "me. Wow, what a great story."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I had a pen pal once."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "But we had to stop writing."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How come?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You couldn't find the time once he became vice president."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "$55 in time, sir."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Last case of the night, sir. Files on its way."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Got a stamp?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Sure. Birth of the world or salute to the cotton gin."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I don't care."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I just want to send this letter off to Alex."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Do you two ever run out of things to say?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No, not yet."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "We write about everything."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Alex has a really interesting take on life."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "A real joie de vivre."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What does he do?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He's a nut salesman from Fresno."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Why can't I ever meet a professional?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "When are you going to finally meet?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Never, I hope."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'm afraid if I ever met Alex, it would take all the fun out of the fantasy."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah, I feel the same way about Lamb Chop."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus Fingers Kirby."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Prosecution? Yes, sir. Fingers was fingered at a downtown hotel after he"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "had picked his way into 27 different rooms and cleaned out all of the honor"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "bars."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How dishonorable of you."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Come on, they charge 18 bucks for a club soda. You should see what they get for a"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "tin of beef jerky."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Defense."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I believe beef jerky runs about $22."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wow, that is a crime."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Unfortunately, it's not the one we're discussing here."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'll hold this over for trial, and good night, folks."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, everybody, don't forget my campaign ad is on tonight. Well, not exactly"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "tonight. More like tomorrow morning."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Early."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How early?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "4.16 a.m."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "At that time of the morning, the only thing I'm going to be watching is the"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "inside of my eyelids."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, what channel is that on?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, hey, hey. It's a great time slot."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Christine's commercial airs between I'll Miss Brooks and that show that stars"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "that vegetable juicer."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You know, you guys can set your VCRs for my debut. I don't expect you to stay up."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I've got a date with my favorite stewardess, Patina. If I pace myself, I"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "should still be up."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I think you're going to be very impressed with this commercial."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "With my artistic eye and brilliant execution, I am confident that this spot"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "is going to put Christine Sullivan on everybody's lips."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Don't, Dan."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "hey, do you want to go to dinner with me? My stewardess can't get back from"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Chicago. She's got a layover, which means that I won't."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Sure, I'll go."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What you doing?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, I'm just looking through some of these old legal texts."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look at this."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Prohibition mandates."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "This is a dry subject."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wow."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Whoa."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look at that. A safe? How did you do that?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I don't know. Must have been this book."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah, there's a hidden trigger back there."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hold on a second. You mean you didn't know that was there? No, I've never seen"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "it. Wow."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That sucker is old."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I wonder what's in it."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "This is not a sandbox. It's my office."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Finders, keep doing what we both saw. Oh, what are we doing?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Probably nothing in there but dust. I'm sure whoever had that safe cleared it"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "out before he left the office."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Probably right."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I bet you nobody even knows it's there."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, you found Judge Grimm's old safe."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You knew about this book?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Sure. Rumor has it the old judge was on a take to the tune of millions."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "lucrative blackmail business."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He supposedly had the goods on all the rich and famous of the time."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Celebrities, politicians, even Houdini."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, then there's probably nothing in there except some old photos and"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "letters. Yeah, probably."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, good night."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Night, Paul."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Night, Paul. See ya."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "If there was ever any doubt about my vote, it was erased last night."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Christine Sullivan must be elected to Congress. Mac, your commercial inspired"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "me. Well, thanks, Harriet. Hey, never underestimate the power of advertising."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'll say."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I taped the wrong commercial, Norm's Auto World."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Now I'm the proud owner of a lime green Pacer."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Mac, the commercial is doing wonders."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "My headquarters has been flooded with new volunteers and pledges of support."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Good for you, Christine. I thought that commercial was great."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Christine, your commercial inspired me so much, I'm pledging my entire piggy"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "bank to your campaign."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, thank you. I just wouldn't feel right about taking your savings."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "And besides, it takes a sizable amount to keep a campaign running."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Okay, I guess you're right."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "My measly $40,000 probably wouldn't make a dent."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "the title producer grab you?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Gee, Dan, got a leak?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "The tools."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, no, no."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Harry has a loose tooth."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "And I'm going to help him pull it. Come along, Harry. Yeah, thanks, Dan."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, you know, my mother used to pull my loose teeth by tying a string around it"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "and attaching the other end to the ceiling fan at Woolworth's."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "work, we'll try that."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Who have you been?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Checking my phone machine."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Any interesting calls?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Just one."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Alec. He's in town and he wants to meet me after work."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, Ross!"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You're gonna finally meet your mystery man."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That's great."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That's a wrap."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Now, look, this computer program will show us all the possible combinations to"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "the... You know what? Come on."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "If this doesn't work, I've got dynamite."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What are you"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "doing?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'm painting the Sistine Chapel."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What does it look like? I'm straightening up."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "In fact, as soon as I finish waxing these floors, I'm gonna go chew out the"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "head janitor well into the night."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You're stalling."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What's the problem, Ross? It's not like Alex is a stranger. There are no"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "surprises."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Are there?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, thinking back, I suppose there have been a couple of"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "times when maybe some of the things I said about myself were slightly"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "embellished."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Such as?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'm a classical music buff."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That's easy."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "If he mentions Mozart, just say, love that third movement."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I also said I was a figure skater."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Skate? With Holiday on Ice."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Anything else?"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "One last thing."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'm five foot two and a size three."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "meet i just got carried away oh roz there are worse things i"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "can't think of any at the moment but there are i can't face him now i lied to"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "him i think you're missing a really great opportunity roz yeah i"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "really would like to get a look at him there's only one way to do that you"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "gotta go"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Or you gotta go."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "on her, but we're having a tough time keeping fingers Kirby and holding."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He's picked every lock in the building."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Any suggestions?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah, Bull, why don't you bring him up here?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "We can probably find something for him to do."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "about my commercial. Something is wrong."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Nothing is wrong, Christine."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Ever since the spot ad, you're up in the polls with male voters 18 to 45."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yes, but I'm losing support fast with the female constituency."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "The Sisters of the Flag canceled my speech and the Amish Girls Club of"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Manhattan just called off their fundraising quilting bee."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, I don't know how you can blame that on my commercial."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well... thing is very unsettling. No, this whole thing is really boring."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Listen, I didn't see your stupid commercial, but you should be happy it's"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "getting you this much attention regardless of which gender it's coming"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "from. That's right, I mean, voters are very fickle."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Maybe those mean old Amish girls are jealous of you."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I don't think so. Well, that outfit really showed off your figure."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, that's fine. Fine!"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Five days of shooting, 20 locations, a brilliant script, and all it comes down"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "to is TNA."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "A technique in attitude."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I have to admit, I was filled with trepidation about meeting you."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I didn't know what to expect, but you are everything I imagined and more, Roz."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You're not so bad yourself."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Alex."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wine?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No, I always talk like this."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He just looks like someone I'm supposed to be."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I mean, no, I've never seen her before."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, the tangled web I weave."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Excuse me. I can't see all the fun I'm having."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Move it."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So, tell me all about that fabulous art collection of yours."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Gee, it's so big I don't know where to start."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Why don't you start with the 18th century neoclassics you picked up on"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "your last trip to Florence?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Pretty neat stuff, huh?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I think I'll have some more wine."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You know, I see a lot of couples in here."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I think those two got chemistry."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I predict a hot night ahead for them."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Arson is a possibility."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Anyway, they're all wrong for you. each other."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I think they make a cute couple."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Who asked you?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, five bucks so they leave here together."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'll take that bet."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "And then there's that, um, uh, glue painting I have. You know, the one that"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "was painted by the artist that was named after the Ninja Turtle?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Raphael? How did you get one of those? They go for millions."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Sold my Rembrandt."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Enough about me."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Let's talk about you."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How's the weather in Fresca?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That's Fresno."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Why don't we forget the talking? Let's dance."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "They're dancing."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No, they say a good dance is a prelude to, uh... A bar brawl."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wow."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wow, back."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You know, Rod, the night is still young."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Why don't you show me the town?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Wow, again."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What is going on?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You're having a great time. Good night."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You win."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I lose."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "As usual."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You ever make a huge mistake you knew you were going to end up regretting"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "every minute for the rest of your life?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah. I bought stock in Earthshoes."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "it this way. The air is human, right?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Here. Here's your five dollars."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "No. It's yours. You want it. No, really. You keep it."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'll tell you what."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Why don't you both use it to buy a drink? Or have we forgotten this is a"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "place of business here?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What do you say?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Got no better place to go."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "And the snacks are free. Yeah, but they're not fresh."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Sure they are."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Give me a break. These nuts have been out of the can for two days."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Bring us some fresh ones."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "When it comes to nuts, I'm an expert."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "We haven't been introduced."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'm Alex Patterson from Fresno, California."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "And you are... Out of here."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, nut man."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "See what you get for busting my chops?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Who was she?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "First you tell me. Who was he?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He. Who?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He. Was she?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He. He was me."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Was she you?"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "She was me."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So, that was us."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Cheapened our whole relationship."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Cheapened? I paid $400 for that actor."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "He's good. He's died on three soap operas."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Mind if I sit down?"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "It's a good idea."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You know, Alex, I'm really embarrassed about all of this."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I don't know what to say except I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Me too, Roz."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "So, what did you think of my chiseled features?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Very studly."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How'd you like my perfect size three?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You look great."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Listen, now that we don't have to, would you like to have dinner with me tonight?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'd love that."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Let's go."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "How about Thai food?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I hate Thai."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "But in your letters you said you loved it."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What can I tell you?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I lied."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Mac,"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "she hates me. I don't get it."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I do."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look, I spoke to the guy who duplicated your commercial, and I think it explains"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "the strange reaction you've been getting."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "What is it?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, you see, to save money, I bought some used..."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Apparently, it hadn't been erased properly because some of the original"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "stuff bled through."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "You know, a frame here and there, kind of subliminal."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Uh-oh."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Yeah, you've been sharing our time with Candy Goodlove, the star of Beauty and"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "the Priest."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "This is so humiliating. We've got to get those commercials off the air."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look, it's already been done. It's no big deal. I'm sure it's already a thing"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "of the past."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I hope you're right."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Hey, Christine Sullivan, I'm voting for you."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "See?"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "That's an interesting place for a bumper sticker."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "All right, if it's cash, the straight 50-50 split."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Right. I get all Houdini-related memorabilia, and you get any"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "compromising blackmail photos and documents."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Deal, deal."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Well, that's stocks and bonds."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "I'll take my cut liquid acids. I've already had some knocks in the market"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "this year."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Just open it."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh! Yes! Yes!"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look at that!"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "Look at that!"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": null, "kind": "source_transcript_text", "start_ms": null, "text": "It's a turkey sandwich."}
